row data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>22</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>","file":"ch00-foundations/09-matrices.html"}